# Popovers + Tooltips Standards

Use the shared Radix wrapper in `components/ui/popover.tsx` for all popovers/tooltips.

## Tooltip-style popovers (for icon buttons like Refresh/Reset)

Use this pattern for icon-only header actions (Refresh, Reset, Help icons) so users understand what the button does.

### Requirements

- Show on **hover** and **keyboard focus**
- Hide on **mouse leave** and **blur**
- Tooltip body should be **non-interactive** (`pointer-events-none`) to avoid flicker
- Match the app’s tooltip styling:
  - rounded-2xl
  - brand border (`border-[var(--brand-strong)]`)
  - translucent brand surface (`bg-[rgb(var(--brand-soft-rgb)/0.35)]`)
  - small text (`text-xs`)
  - include a `PopoverArrow` with matching fill + stroke

### Reference implementation (copy/paste)

```tsx
const [tooltipOpen, setTooltipOpen] = useState(false)
const isDisabled = false

<Popover open={!isDisabled && tooltipOpen} onOpenChange={() => {}}>
  <PopoverTrigger asChild>
    <button
      type="button"
      aria-label="Refresh data"
      disabled={isDisabled}
      onClick={handleRefresh}
      onMouseEnter={() => !isDisabled && setTooltipOpen(true)}
      onMouseLeave={() => setTooltipOpen(false)}
      onFocus={() => !isDisabled && setTooltipOpen(true)}
      onBlur={() => setTooltipOpen(false)}
      className={`btn-pill inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/10 transition ${
        isDisabled
          ? "cursor-not-allowed bg-gray-400/50 text-gray-500"
          : "bg-[var(--cta)] text-[var(--cta-foreground)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md active:translate-y-px active:scale-[0.98]"
      }`}
    >
      <RotateCcw className="h-4 w-4" />
    </button>
  </PopoverTrigger>
  <PopoverContent
    side="right"
    align="center"
    sideOffset={8}
    className="pointer-events-none w-auto rounded-2xl border-[var(--brand-strong)] bg-[rgb(var(--brand-soft-rgb)/0.35)] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-foreground shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md"
  >
    <PopoverArrow
      width={12}
      height={8}
      className="fill-[rgb(var(--brand-soft-rgb)/0.35)] stroke-[var(--brand-strong)] stroke-1"
    />
    Reload data
  </PopoverContent>
</Popover>
```

## Dropdown-style popovers (interactive)

If the popover contains clickable items (dropdown menus, searchable lists), do NOT use `pointer-events-none` on the content.

- Close on outside click
- Close on Escape
- Ensure the trigger has `aria-expanded`

